WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
ずっと信じている

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.420 --> 00:10.050
I have always believed

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:10.180 --> 00:14.560
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.560 --> 00:17.850
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.570 --> 00:31.490
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
空回りするけど

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.490 --> 00:34.200
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.660 --> 00:37.870
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.000 --> 00:41.590
You should be yourself.

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.710 --> 00:47.430
But you know... a messed up scenario

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.090 --> 00:54.600
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.600 --> 00:56.100
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.140 --> 01:01.560
The wind... it caresses my cheek.

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.820 --> 01:05.240
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.240 --> 01:10.120
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.240 --> 01:15.750
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.000 --> 01:20.330
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.330 --> 01:23.960
TRUST ME MY WAY

02:11.090 --> 02:11.800
Pochi.

02:19.180 --> 02:19.920
All right.

02:20.540 --> 02:21.710
I'm going to do my best!

02:26.020 --> 02:35.030
There's a rumor that this boy in the midst of puberty who inherited his parents' fortune and is living all by himself with no supervision has surrounded himself with tender young girls in a huge mansion, thus living out his fantasies and creating his own world of desire as he makes them serve him.

02:36.350 --> 02:38.640
Good morning, Master!

02:39.020 --> 02:40.680
Morning, Mitsuki-chan!

02:41.020 --> 02:43.450
Are you going to feed the koi in the garden this morning as well?

02:43.640 --> 02:44.300
Yeah!

02:48.260 --> 02:49.690
Just as you asked, it's finished.

02:50.200 --> 02:51.900
I've finished digging a hole in the garden!

02:52.370 --> 02:53.960
What's with you this morning?!

02:54.390 --> 02:55.220
Good job.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.310
Now hurry up and go fill that hole into how it used to be.

02:57.780 --> 02:58.600
I need that done right away!

02:58.720 --> 03:00.340
You're just making me do meaningless crap!

03:02.720 --> 03:04.050
Ah, fine, I'll just do it.

03:04.340 --> 03:04.920
I'll do it.

03:07.040 --> 03:07.920
Izumi-san!

03:08.830 --> 03:09.860
Ah, good morning, Anna-ch-

03:13.000 --> 03:14.680
This is Izumi-san's residue!

03:14.980 --> 03:16.190
Izumi-saaaan!

03:17.960 --> 03:21.640
Do you ever regret hiring Anna-san... even a little bit?

03:21.850 --> 03:22.650
Never!

03:23.070 --> 03:26.110
With this, I have yet another precious middle-school maid!

03:26.750 --> 03:28.990
With this alone, my life has been worth living!

03:29.760 --> 03:32.610
Do you think I'd be satisfied with just this?

03:33.100 --> 03:34.620
I don't think so!

03:35.080 --> 03:35.750
You got it.

03:38.020 --> 03:38.880
Rei!

03:38.020 --> 03:42.100
The koi are all named after characters from other GAINAX shows, namely Neon Genesis Evangelion and Gunbuster

03:39.040 --> 03:39.750
Askuka!

03:39.830 --> 03:40.670
Noriko!

03:40.790 --> 03:41.380
Kasumi!

03:41.410 --> 03:42.100
Jung!

03:42.650 --> 03:43.680
Time to eat!

03:46.630 --> 03:47.220
Huh?

03:47.380 --> 03:48.140
What's wrong?

03:50.080 --> 03:50.960
Linda!

04:03.870 --> 04:05.490
You son of a...

04:06.910 --> 04:07.830
I'm tired.

04:08.560 --> 04:11.680
That idiot is making me do nothing but busywork!

04:11.840 --> 04:13.430
My muscles will get huge!

04:13.770 --> 04:15.880
Izumi-san looks wonderful when she's covered in sweat!

04:16.290 --> 04:17.460
Hey!

04:17.910 --> 04:19.050
Izumi

04:19.960 --> 04:21.720
Thanks to Pochi, all the koi in my pond are gone!

04:21.840 --> 04:22.620
What are you going to do about it?!

04:23.190 --> 04:25.350
I'm so sorry, Master!

04:26.460 --> 04:28.550
No, Mitsuki-chan, you don't need to worry about it.

04:28.900 --> 04:30.000
Because this is being added to <i>your</i> debt!

04:30.370 --> 04:32.880
What's with that obvious difference in treatment?!

04:34.590 --> 04:35.600
Hey, we have guests.

04:36.140 --> 04:37.050
Hurry up and go!

04:37.230 --> 04:38.190
Yeah, yeah.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.940
They're <i>your</i> guests, aren't they?

04:45.430 --> 04:47.410
Yes, may I ask who's there?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.610
IZUMIII!!!

04:55.040 --> 04:56.830
H-How did you know I was here?!

04:58.320 --> 04:59.860
Izumi...

05:01.250 --> 05:02.220
IZUMI!

05:06.720 --> 05:08.890
What are you trying to do to my Izumi-san?

05:09.020 --> 05:09.970
Hey!

05:10.360 --> 05:11.500
Who the hell are you?!

05:12.010 --> 05:14.020
How dare you do perverted things to my maids!

05:14.130 --> 05:15.230
WHAT DO YOU MEAN 'PERVERTED'?!

05:15.790 --> 05:17.510
This is an expression of love between a parent and his child!

05:19.250 --> 05:19.980
Parent and child?

05:20.500 --> 05:23.600
You look like you're having fun, making all that noise.

05:24.300 --> 05:26.160
It's been a while, Izumi.

05:27.940 --> 05:29.150
Mom!

05:29.440 --> 05:30.600
And Dad too?

05:30.990 --> 05:33.640
I'm glad to see you two are doing well.

05:34.120 --> 05:34.750
Here you are.

05:35.310 --> 05:36.150
Thank you.

05:37.600 --> 05:40.580
Earlier, I showed you my playful side.

05:41.110 --> 05:46.670
Um, I'm Kurauchi Anna, a companion of Izumi-san who intends to marry her.

05:46.840 --> 05:48.860
Sorry, but could you be quiet, Anna-chan?

05:49.480 --> 05:49.910
So?

05:50.640 --> 05:51.670
What the hell do you want with me?

05:51.820 --> 05:53.180
'What do I want with you'?!

05:53.550 --> 05:54.650
It's obvious!

05:55.040 --> 05:56.040
Give us back our daug-

06:00.390 --> 06:03.940
Fa-th-e-r!

06:04.350 --> 06:06.020
Your mother is incredibly young!

06:06.210 --> 06:07.270
She's 30.

06:07.310 --> 06:09.800
She had me when she was 16.

06:11.560 --> 06:13.550
Just as I thought, the rumors were true!

06:13.740 --> 06:14.620
The rumors?

06:14.840 --> 06:15.750
What are you talking about?

06:16.150 --> 06:17.020
Don't play dumb!

06:17.850 --> 06:21.320
There's a rumor that this boy in the midst of puberty who inherited his parents' fortune and is living all by himself

06:21.460 --> 06:22.980
with no supervision has surrounded himself with tender young girls

06:23.090 --> 06:27.610
in a huge mansion, thus living out his fantasies and creating his own world of desire

06:27.770 --> 06:28.990
as he makes them serve him.

06:29.750 --> 06:30.900
That rumor!

06:31.210 --> 06:32.690
That's a terrible way to put it.

06:32.800 --> 06:33.860
That's <i>not</i> how it is!

06:34.120 --> 06:35.550
But we were worried.

06:35.960 --> 06:38.420
So won't you two come home already?

06:38.770 --> 06:39.980
No way!

06:40.600 --> 06:43.620
To think that Izumi-san and I would be forced to separate already...

06:43.760 --> 06:44.420
I don't want to!

06:45.050 --> 06:46.060
I'm not going home!

06:46.710 --> 06:49.250
If it's not with Pochi, I'm never going home!

06:50.110 --> 06:50.920
Mitsuki!

06:51.140 --> 06:52.130
Don't be selfish.

06:52.360 --> 06:53.260
You understand, don't you?

06:53.610 --> 06:57.440
We can't keep such a big, violent alligator in a normal house like ours.

06:57.520 --> 06:58.240
That's right.

06:58.420 --> 06:59.530
That's why we're going to live here.

06:59.790 --> 07:01.250
There are spacious gardens here,

07:01.790 --> 07:03.850
and Master is a very nice person!

07:04.050 --> 07:07.290
He's more than willing to keep Pochi here!

07:07.520 --> 07:08.630
Right, Master?

07:09.320 --> 07:10.730
Of course!

07:10.910 --> 07:11.670
There, you see?

07:12.660 --> 07:15.370
YOU CALL THIS MAN 'MASTER'?!

07:15.810 --> 07:18.960
Moreover, if something happened while you were living with a man in a place like this...

07:19.030 --> 07:21.120
It's not that different from when we were at home.

07:21.550 --> 07:24.070
I was always suspicious of the way you looked at us...

07:24.440 --> 07:25.620
That's...

07:26.420 --> 07:30.430
Your father... Izumi, Mitsuki...

07:31.070 --> 07:32.320
You two... both of you...

07:33.310 --> 07:36.900
I love you both like I do your mother!

07:37.040 --> 07:38.810
I said that's disgusting.

07:39.290 --> 07:41.970
You're no different from Yoshitaka.

07:42.270 --> 07:44.000
Just how are this old man and I alike?

07:44.230 --> 07:46.060
Don't compare me to this perverted brat!

07:56.550 --> 07:59.540
Do you know the kind of hardships we have been going through?

07:59.910 --> 08:01.630
Birds of a feather certainly flock together!

08:01.960 --> 08:04.330
Anyway, you're going to return my daughters!

08:05.040 --> 08:06.070
I can't do that.

08:06.440 --> 08:08.880
These two are indebted to me.

08:09.190 --> 08:12.020
They're working as maids in order to repay me.

08:12.420 --> 08:13.930
A debt?

08:14.540 --> 08:15.840
If you want me to return your daughters,

08:15.870 --> 08:17.610
then <i>you</i> take the burden of the debt instead.

08:17.740 --> 08:20.220
So just how large of a debt are we talking about?

08:20.410 --> 08:21.190
Well, you see...

08:23.110 --> 08:26.360
We can't pay you that kind of money anytime soon!

08:26.560 --> 08:27.830
This is quite troublesome.

08:28.810 --> 08:31.970
By the way, who decided to use these uniforms?

08:32.280 --> 08:33.490
Master did!

08:33.790 --> 08:35.240
He said he sewed them himself!

08:35.850 --> 08:36.880
They're incredible, aren't they?

08:37.300 --> 08:39.840
Yoshitaka-kun, do you like these sort of things?

08:40.110 --> 08:40.710
Yes, ma'am!

08:42.570 --> 08:43.550
Well then, Izumi,

08:43.760 --> 08:47.740
when Yoshitaka-kun turns 18, I want you to marry him!

08:49.350 --> 08:51.810
This way, she can marry someone with money and Pochi will be take care of!

08:51.840 --> 08:52.950
It all works out perfectly!

08:53.180 --> 08:55.110
Mom, that's great!

08:57.960 --> 09:01.520
Izumi and I will marry, Mitsuki-chan will work here...

09:01.920 --> 09:02.950
Which means...

09:03.570 --> 09:06.040
I'll be living with my sister-in-law!

09:03.580 --> 09:05.690
Mitsuki, shall I rinse your back?

09:05.740 --> 09:06.680
Sure, Onii-chan!

09:06.010 --> 09:09.540
'Onii-chan' (お兄ちゃん) has the same connotations as 'Onee-chan" except referring to one's older brother.

09:07.330 --> 09:08.660
Yeah, I definitely won't be able to hold myself back!

09:09.130 --> 09:09.460
All right!

09:09.640 --> 09:11.630
If that's how it is, I'll write off the debt!

09:13.600 --> 09:14.240
I won't allow it!

09:14.620 --> 09:15.480
Izumi, Mitsuki!

09:15.700 --> 09:16.640
And you, Mizuho!

09:16.790 --> 09:18.160
What kind of nonsense are you talking about?!

09:18.320 --> 09:19.540
That would be a problem for me!

09:19.760 --> 09:20.630
Really?

09:20.800 --> 09:22.920
I thought it solved everything peacefully...

09:23.230 --> 09:24.240
This isn't a joke!

09:24.290 --> 09:26.010
I refuse to marry a pervert like him!

09:26.260 --> 09:28.880
Why, Izumi, don't you want to stay here?

09:30.270 --> 09:31.800
I don't have anywhere else to go...

09:32.250 --> 09:34.250
Then you should come home!

09:34.720 --> 09:36.640
And besides, Izumi,

09:37.390 --> 09:39.110
it looks like Yoshitaka-kun is pretty interested in you.

09:41.590 --> 09:42.650
Okay, okay!

09:42.990 --> 09:44.820
Then I have a proposal!

09:45.110 --> 09:47.540
I bet Mitsuki is going to say something weird again.

09:47.910 --> 09:51.790
I want to live with the person who can get along well with Pochi.

09:51.920 --> 09:52.990
What?

09:53.240 --> 09:55.120
I always do that!

09:55.320 --> 09:56.960
Mitsuki, listen to what Daddy says...

09:57.230 --> 09:58.930
I don't want to. That's why I won't come home.

09:59.900 --> 10:02.470
From now on, Pochi is going to protect Onee-chan.

10:02.680 --> 10:07.950
So, Master and Dad, please win Pochi over and take away Onee-chan.

10:08.250 --> 10:08.970
Oh, my!

10:09.140 --> 10:10.100
That's great!

10:10.510 --> 10:13.850
Mitsuki, why are you proposing something so ludicrous again?!

10:14.190 --> 10:18.040
But isn't it wonderful, having three people fight over one woman?

10:18.240 --> 10:21.810
'Three people', by which you mean my father, a pervert, and a beast!

10:22.120 --> 10:25.570
But I'll<i> be the one to make Izumi-san mine in the end!</i>

10:26.380 --> 10:28.680
Well then, let's start!

10:28.960 --> 10:31.440
Master, do your best, all right?

10:31.740 --> 10:33.540
She won't be yours if you lose!

10:33.630 --> 10:35.690
Honey, don't try so hard, all right?

10:36.430 --> 10:38.400
Mitsuki... and Mizuho too!

10:39.410 --> 10:40.480
That has to sting!

10:40.740 --> 10:43.710
Pochi, protect Onee-chan like you always do, all right?

10:45.260 --> 10:47.220
On your marks, get set...

10:47.240 --> 10:48.310
START!

10:50.100 --> 10:52.160
I got taken for a ride by Mitsuki again.

10:52.590 --> 10:53.790
I don't really want either one.

10:54.400 --> 10:56.660
Pochi, be sure to protect m-

11:05.610 --> 11:08.970
It looks like he misunderstood me when I said 'just like always'!

11:09.130 --> 11:10.000
That alligator!

11:10.120 --> 11:11.410
That beast got the drop on us?

11:11.570 --> 11:12.940
Waaait!

11:13.010 --> 11:16.120
I can't allow you to take Izumi-san away from me!

11:16.340 --> 11:17.370
Pochi!

11:18.450 --> 11:19.940
Looks like Anna-san's joining the fray, too!

11:20.250 --> 11:21.540
So what about you, Mitsuki?

11:21.590 --> 11:22.620
Are you just going to wait?

11:37.180 --> 11:39.840
Come on, why am I always in situations like this?

11:40.260 --> 11:42.910
IZUMI!

11:44.970 --> 11:46.840
Give me back my maid!

11:47.490 --> 11:49.880
I-ZU-MI!

11:50.250 --> 11:52.110
I'll make my dreams come true this time!

11:54.000 --> 11:56.830
At this rate, I'm starting to think that I would be better off not being captured.

11:57.230 --> 11:58.850
How dare you make Izumi cry!

11:59.090 --> 12:00.670
Pochi, what have you done?

12:00.820 --> 12:01.250
I can't forgive you!

12:01.890 --> 12:03.020
I'm going to save you now, Izumi!

12:03.430 --> 12:04.520
Pochi, look at these!

12:06.810 --> 12:08.880
Pictures from when Izumi was little!

12:09.940 --> 12:11.260
Stop it!

12:11.640 --> 12:12.820
That's right, this way, this way.

12:12.930 --> 12:13.530
Pochi!

12:13.640 --> 12:14.590
I have this!

12:15.990 --> 12:18.150
I thought I lost that bra-

12:20.250 --> 12:20.740
Hold it!

12:20.860 --> 12:22.030
I have these movies!

12:22.320 --> 12:26.240
Your relationship with Izumi since the first episode has transformed into something great!

12:26.390 --> 12:28.110
It's a treasured DVD anthology!

12:31.770 --> 12:32.370
All right!

12:32.450 --> 12:33.160
Now, Izumi!

12:33.190 --> 12:34.200
I'll capture y-

12:35.220 --> 12:37.190
What the hell are you doing?!

12:38.450 --> 12:39.890
What is this?!

12:39.890 --> 12:40.510
Wait, Pochi!

12:41.000 --> 12:42.290
I have something even better!

12:45.250 --> 12:47.710
Izumi and Mitsuki's kindergarten uniforms!

12:47.990 --> 12:49.430
Nooo!

12:49.540 --> 12:50.710
Why do you have those as well?!

12:50.970 --> 12:52.560
And why does Yoshitaka want them?!

12:53.050 --> 12:53.720
Enough!

12:54.010 --> 12:55.860
Everyone, please stop this!

12:56.010 --> 12:56.810
This is terrible!

12:57.010 --> 12:59.380
You're only hurting Izumi-san with this!

12:59.750 --> 13:02.020
Wait. Weren't you with us, Anna-chan?

13:02.150 --> 13:04.480
This is all wrong because you have such things!

13:04.800 --> 13:07.030
Such things... such things...

13:07.940 --> 13:08.910
She ran away with them, didn't she?

13:09.470 --> 13:10.540
She ran away with them.

13:12.190 --> 13:12.540
In that case...

13:12.870 --> 13:14.140
TAKE THIS!

13:16.340 --> 13:17.160
I DID IT!

13:17.780 --> 13:18.410
How do you like that?

13:18.610 --> 13:19.950
This match is my victory!

13:20.120 --> 13:22.210
You didn't win Pochi over, so it's no good.

13:23.500 --> 13:24.930
Po~chi!

13:26.880 --> 13:27.550
Pochi!

13:27.740 --> 13:29.900
Take my hand and let's kick that old man out!

13:30.630 --> 13:32.210
If you do so, then from now on

13:32.240 --> 13:33.500
you'll live here in a detached house in the garden.

13:33.700 --> 13:37.480
You can even have your own exclusive address.

13:37.760 --> 13:38.460
And on top of that...

13:39.340 --> 13:42.680
It will be fully air-conditioned, provide unlimited Internet access, have the newest AV system, and...

13:42.950 --> 13:46.780
if you act now, I'll include cute female alligators and cute maids!

13:43.930 --> 13:45.940
Would you like some more, Pochi?

13:46.990 --> 13:48.590
What's with this image?!

13:50.360 --> 13:52.250
It looks like he's done a wonderful job of winning him over!

13:52.620 --> 13:53.830
Isn't he just bribing him?

13:54.200 --> 13:56.010
I can't... accept that...

13:56.740 --> 13:59.090
He's just letting his money do the talking!

13:59.180 --> 14:00.340
Shut it, poor man!

14:00.850 --> 14:03.450
Well, all I have to do now is capture Izumi!

14:04.410 --> 14:05.620
There she is!

14:04.770 --> 14:06.280
You think I'd let you?!

14:06.360 --> 14:09.130
Onee-chan, if you want to keep living like this,

14:09.160 --> 14:11.110
then you should get captured by Master!

14:11.290 --> 14:12.250
Yup.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.400
That's right.

14:13.730 --> 14:15.770
I really don't want to, but I guess I have no choice.

14:16.100 --> 14:17.910
Izumi-chan!

14:18.100 --> 14:19.610
Yoshitaka-kun!

14:21.440 --> 14:23.170
Just as I thought, I CAN'T!

14:24.140 --> 14:24.800
Mom!

14:26.160 --> 14:26.940
Izumi!

14:27.070 --> 14:28.120
This way!

14:28.530 --> 14:32.050
Mooom, help meee!

14:35.190 --> 14:37.740
My, Izumi, you've certainly grown!

14:38.010 --> 14:40.190
What are you thinking, Mom?!

14:40.890 --> 14:43.390
Master, now's your chance!

14:43.810 --> 14:44.760
All right!

14:45.140 --> 14:45.750
No!

14:45.910 --> 14:46.830
I won't allow that!

14:50.670 --> 14:52.160
Is that all right?

14:52.300 --> 14:52.970
It's fine!

14:53.010 --> 14:55.070
Something like this is nothing for Pochi!

14:55.240 --> 14:56.490
He'lll wake up shortly.

14:56.880 --> 14:58.620
I don't know about Dad, though...

14:59.760 --> 15:01.720
Well, Yoshitaka-kun!

15:01.760 --> 15:03.820
Capture Izumi while you can!

15:04.100 --> 15:06.460
And while you're at it, seal the deal with a kiss!

15:08.220 --> 15:08.650
All right!

15:08.680 --> 15:09.650
You did it, Onee-chan!

15:10.390 --> 15:11.440
Don't be stupid!

15:11.740 --> 15:13.540
Why do he and I have to...

15:14.390 --> 15:15.770
Give it up, we got you.

15:15.990 --> 15:17.120
We got her, all right!

15:17.430 --> 15:18.950
This parent and child...

15:20.930 --> 15:22.710
It's all over.

15:23.100 --> 15:26.530
My first kiss is going to be taken by this pervert!

15:27.160 --> 15:28.540
He'll definitely do it!

15:29.090 --> 15:34.560
There's no doubt that he would be okay with forcibly kissing a woman who can't move!

15:35.220 --> 15:36.970
Save me, God!

15:37.060 --> 15:42.040
The butterfly is a reference to Kono Minikuku mo Utsukushii Sekai (This Ugly and Beautiful World), another GAINAX show.

15:42.770 --> 15:44.700
Don't look so frightened, Izumi.

15:45.790 --> 15:46.480
Yoshitaka?

15:46.870 --> 15:47.600
Why aren't you...

15:48.250 --> 15:50.250
I may not look like it, but I'm a feminist.

15:50.920 --> 15:55.010
I would never do something cruel to a woman who can't move.

15:55.890 --> 15:56.780
Yoshitaka...

15:59.660 --> 16:02.340
THAT... WAS... A... LIE!

16:03.260 --> 16:04.700
You though you were saved?

16:04.940 --> 16:08.950
It's more effective to let you feel happiness one last time before driving you to the depths of despair!

16:09.450 --> 16:12.460
There's no way I would pass up such a delicious situation!

16:14.050 --> 16:15.000
You lowlife!

16:16.170 --> 16:17.090
Ah, is that a good idea?

16:17.260 --> 16:18.660
If you take away your hand, I'll see everything!

16:18.870 --> 16:19.890
Nooo!

16:20.740 --> 16:22.340
My, Yoshitaka-kun certainly is twisted!

16:22.420 --> 16:23.930
Onee-chan, just like that!

16:24.000 --> 16:24.920
Hey!

16:25.060 --> 16:26.530
And now the prize...

16:27.470 --> 16:28.980
I can't believe my first kiss will...

16:29.250 --> 16:31.770
be taken by this scumbag!

16:45.520 --> 16:47.390
Thank you, Pochi!

16:49.540 --> 16:51.830
Why you!

16:56.340 --> 16:59.030
I can't allow you to steal my spotlight, Pochi.

17:01.320 --> 17:03.460
Izumi-san belongs to me!

17:04.660 --> 17:05.680
Anna-chan!

17:06.060 --> 17:07.150
Calm down!

17:07.610 --> 17:09.800
Is it always like this around here?

17:10.020 --> 17:10.520
Yeah!

17:10.770 --> 17:12.250
It's a lot of fun!

17:12.500 --> 17:13.200
I see.

17:15.200 --> 17:19.940
Your father is still out cold, so we're going to go home now.

17:20.120 --> 17:21.150
Yoshitaka-kun,

17:21.700 --> 17:23.710
there's nothing to hold you back.

17:24.090 --> 17:25.890
Feel free to do whatever you desire!

17:26.010 --> 17:26.640
Of course!

17:27.090 --> 17:27.620
Anna-chan,

17:28.080 --> 17:30.160
love has nothing to do with gender.

17:30.340 --> 17:31.600
Go for the gusto!

17:31.950 --> 17:33.510
I will, Mother!

17:33.810 --> 17:34.500
Mitsuki,

17:34.920 --> 17:37.830
work cheerfully while having as much fun as you can

17:37.840 --> 17:39.060
and pay off the debt, all right?

17:39.180 --> 17:39.770
Okay!

17:40.190 --> 17:42.370
And Izumi, accept everything that I said, OK?

17:42.750 --> 17:44.480
Absolutely not!

17:46.890 --> 17:47.540
What?

17:47.890 --> 17:49.650
I'm really not going home!

17:50.130 --> 17:53.460
Actually, Karin really wanted to see you.

17:54.910 --> 17:57.190
Show your face around her every once in a while.

17:57.530 --> 18:00.220
Karin... I feel bad about her.

18:00.740 --> 18:01.880
But it's still no good.

18:02.320 --> 18:06.130
We still can't... go home.

18:07.830 --> 18:08.560
I see.

18:10.290 --> 18:11.540
Well, I'll see you later!

18:18.270 --> 18:20.020
We've been so busy since this morning!

18:20.240 --> 18:21.350
I think I'll go take a shower.

18:21.720 --> 18:24.500
I'll join you, Izumi-san!

18:25.990 --> 18:28.100
Hey Mitsuki-chan, uh...

18:28.880 --> 18:31.200
Why are you so protective of Pochi?

18:31.850 --> 18:36.320
You fought with your father and even ran away from home... for the sake of that alligator...

18:41.310 --> 18:44.900
We had two other alligators at my house.

18:45.820 --> 18:50.710
They were with us since I was small, and we treated them like siblings.

18:51.510 --> 18:55.840
They grew bigger and bigger, and Dad started to worry.

18:56.960 --> 18:58.100
And then that day...

19:02.030 --> 19:05.090
those two suddenly attacked me.

19:05.950 --> 19:09.760
I was injured, and Dad was incredibly angry...

19:11.440 --> 19:14.760
They were taken to the clinic and put down.

19:15.730 --> 19:19.470
I didn't know why they had gone berserk...

19:27.370 --> 19:29.980
but... I finally understood.

19:31.350 --> 19:34.290
They were just protecting their egg,

19:34.640 --> 19:37.280
and because I got too close without realizing it...

19:39.030 --> 19:40.390
Could that egg have been...

19:41.320 --> 19:45.430
I raised him from that egg, keeping it a secret the whole time,

19:45.710 --> 19:49.360
but he was found, and Dad said he would get rid of it.

19:49.900 --> 19:51.560
But I couldn't allow that!

19:52.530 --> 19:54.460
What happened to Pochi's parents was my fault,

19:55.040 --> 19:56.760
but to let it happen to Pochi, too...

19:57.630 --> 19:58.440
Mitsuki-chan...

19:59.340 --> 20:01.840
Onee-chan was worried about me

20:02.040 --> 20:04.230
and suggested that we run away.

20:05.250 --> 20:06.280
I see.

20:07.550 --> 20:09.180
She also went through hard times.

20:11.580 --> 20:14.640
I did it for the sake of my family.

20:15.040 --> 20:16.820
To protect my family...

20:18.220 --> 20:19.770
I guess you just can't have it your way...

20:21.280 --> 20:23.890
Well, this will be Pochi's house starting today!

20:28.080 --> 20:28.960
It's incredible!

20:29.500 --> 20:31.010
Isn't this great, Pochi?

20:44.100 --> 20:45.560
Pochi, Pochi.

20:46.240 --> 20:48.100
I love you, I love you.

20:49.740 --> 20:50.590
Like it?

20:50.930 --> 20:53.360
As promised, I included female alligators, maids, and...

20:57.950 --> 20:58.540
Hey!

20:58.820 --> 20:59.870
Open up, Pochi!

21:00.820 --> 21:01.700
Pochi!

21:01.890 --> 21:02.930
Pochi!

21:03.300 --> 21:04.960
I'm sorry, all right?

21:05.040 --> 21:05.760
Hey!

21:20.160 --> 21:21.570
Let's go, Mitsuki!

21:27.340 --> 21:29.420
Today's profit was really good!

21:30.120 --> 21:35.280
We were able to get most of Onee-chan's treasured goods back from Anna-san after some shady dealing,

21:35.870 --> 21:38.050
and Pochi got his own room!

21:39.640 --> 21:41.870
'I'm uploading some new works,

21:42.240 --> 21:45.050
so everyone please take care of us from now on!'

21:48.460 --> 21:50.690
I guess I really pushed myself too hard today.

21:51.260 --> 21:52.440
My body won't move.

21:52.840 --> 21:54.600
My mind is completely blank!

21:55.300 --> 21:58.910
Those bastards left me locked in that room for five hours!

21:59.430 --> 22:01.730
Mitsuki, let's sleep together tonight.

22:01.890 --> 22:02.200
Huh?

22:02.410 --> 22:13.210
Izumi's debt from today

22:02.490 --> 22:04.130
Sure, all right, Onee-chan.

22:05.330 --> 22:08.380
Those two fools, just getting a bra doesn't mean you got it all!

22:08.390 --> 22:13.210
How much Izumi has left before she pays off her debt

22:27.510 --> 22:30.940
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.510 --> 22:30.940
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.510 --> 22:30.940
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:30.950 --> 22:34.690
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.950 --> 22:34.690
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:30.950 --> 22:34.690
and they're not weak either.

22:34.720 --> 22:39.660
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.720 --> 22:39.660
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.720 --> 22:39.660
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.740 --> 22:44.950
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.740 --> 22:44.950
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.740 --> 22:44.950
Because they're stubborn,

22:45.030 --> 22:48.810
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:45.030 --> 22:48.810
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:45.030 --> 22:48.810
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.820 --> 22:53.540
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.820 --> 22:53.540
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.820 --> 22:53.540
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.240 --> 22:55.870
どうかナ?

22:54.240 --> 22:55.870
dou ka na?

22:54.240 --> 22:55.870
I wonder...

22:56.150 --> 23:02.270
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.150 --> 23:02.270
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.150 --> 23:02.270
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.400 --> 23:09.890
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.400 --> 23:09.890
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.400 --> 23:09.890
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:09.990 --> 23:16.770
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:09.990 --> 23:16.770
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:09.990 --> 23:16.770
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:17.030 --> 23:23.750
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:17.030 --> 23:23.750
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:17.030 --> 23:23.750
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.070 --> 23:31.080
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.070 --> 23:31.080
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.070 --> 23:31.080
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.140 --> 23:38.190
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.140 --> 23:38.190
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.140 --> 23:38.190
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:44.800 --> 23:45.660
Bing-bong!

23:45.940 --> 23:48.510
We have a correction to make in this episode!

23:48.820 --> 23:50.440
As you all know,

23:50.640 --> 23:54.270
I helped myself to Izumi-san's first kiss in the previous episode!

23:54.690 --> 24:00.080
That's why there's no need to worry about it being taken by someone else again, Izumi-san.

24:00.200 --> 24:02.170
What are you talking about, Anna-chan?!

24:02.320 --> 24:04.200
You just pressed your mouth over mine!

24:05.110 --> 24:08.150
Just as I thought, it's so much fun being first!

24:08.210 --> 24:13.160
The Sawatari Izumi Contest Series! A Daring Test of Courage! An Express Train to a Secret Hot Spring in the Northeast, a Mother-in-law Murdered in the Mist, a Madonna Teacher from an Elite Family Burning with Desire as They Watch a Housewife Battle For Control of Her Troubled Mansion!

24:08.420 --> 24:09.140
No, no!

24:09.340 --> 24:10.770
I won't acknowledge it!

24:11.040 --> 24:12.330
The next episode has yukatas!
